# SHA256 of the DeepFilterNet files that Audora's Studio noise removal ships with.
# They come from the deepfilternet-slim 0.1.0 Windows wheel on PyPI:
#   https://pypi.org/project/deepfilternet-slim/0.1.0/
# The wheel line is the hash that PyPI's signed publishing record names for that file.
# The two files inside it are the ones the lab benchmark used (docs/LAB.md).
# scripts/studio.sh stops when any of them does not match. To change a line, check the new file first.
